message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "GLP-1 technical development and validation code (Part I)"
abstract: >-
  Technical development and validation code for the GLP-1 receptor agonist
  patient-journey study: physician adjudication analysis, inter-rater agreement,
  benchmark comparison against the HPO gold-standard corpus, fine-tuned and
  base language-model evaluation, and phenotype concept-discovery analysis.
